5865,126.9814,"40 Samcheong-ro","Tue - Sat 10:00–18:00","","","","r","Established in 2001, PKM Gallery is known for its sleek, modern architecture and thoughtfully curated exhibitions that span painting, sculpture, multimedia, and installation art. The gallery actively participates in global art fairs and…"],["National Children's Science Museum","sight",37.58217,126.99714,"215, Changgyeonggung-ro","09:30~17:30 Mon Off","","","","r","It is a science museum for children."],["Sungkyunkwan","sight",37.58537,126.9961,"","","","","","r","Sungkyunkwan was the highest educational institution during the Joseon dynasty since 1398. Students, including the royal family, studied Confucianism and other courses in Sungkyunkwan and became government officials and scholars. Munmyo…"],["Bukchon Observatory","sight",37.58309,126.98274,"35-62 Samcheong-dong","","","","","r","Provides a sweeping view of Bukchon Village and the greater Seoul cityscape, with Lotte Tower and the palace both clearly visible. It’s humble: clearly a converted apartment, and so tucked away its easy to miss, but it’s a great place…"],["Bukchon Hanok Village","activity",37.58122,126.98146,"84-1, Pildong 2(i)-ga, Jung-gu","10:00-17:00","","","","r","The collective name of the few tiny suburbs (\"dong\") wedged between Gyeongbuk Palace and the Secret Garden, just north of Insadong and Anguk Station. This area was where relatives of the royal family, high public officials, and other…"],["Institute of Korean Royal Cuisine","activity",37.58355,126.98924,"34, Wonseo-dong","For class times, inquire in advance","","","","r","As the name implies, you learn how to prepare royal cuisine, as well as rice cakes and hangwa (Korean cookies)."],["Samcheong Sujaebi","restaurant",37.58454,126.98202,"","","","","","r","Canteen style ambiance, renowned for serving good Sujaebi - a mild soup where the noodles are flattened and torn into sheets. Always packed with people so be prepared for a queue."],["Pungnyeon Ssal Nongsan","restaurant",37.58095,126.98165,"32 Bukchon-ro 5ga-gil, Jongno District","11:00-20:00","","","","r","cheap snack places. noodle sausage, fried stuff, fried rice cake..."],["Yukmian","restaurant",37.58325,126.99944,"182-1 Myeongnyun 2-ga","12:00-23:00","","","","r","Yukmian is a restaurant that offers beef noodle dishes, located near Daehak-ro. The menu features various cuts of beef served with noodles in a broth. The restaurant is known for its focus on quality ingredients and simple preparation.…"],["UjauKimchi Tteokbokki","restaurant",37.58286,126.99956,"Myeongryun 4-ga 59-3","11:00-23:00","","","","r","Yuja Yoo Tteokbokki is a restaurant that specializes in tteokbokki, a popular Korean dish made from rice cakes. The restaurant offers a variety of tteokbokki options with different levels of spice and flavors."],["Goen","bar",37.58431,126.99991,"Myeongryun 2-ga 8-30","16:00-1:00","","","","r","Goen in Hyehwa is a Japanese restaurant that offers a variety of dishes, including sushi, sashimi, and other traditional Japanese cuisine. The restaurant is known for its fresh ingredients and authentic flavors, providing a comfortable…"],["Sseolgeuregori Stroop waffle","bar",37.58078,126.98184,"Jongrogu bukchonro 5 28","10:00-19:00","","","","r","This cafe specializes in Stroop waffle, an authentic Dutch dessert, and serves fresh waffles that are made on the fly."],["Traditional Crafts Experience Center","activity",37.5826,126.983,"24-5, Bukchon-ro 12-gil, Gahoe-dong, Jongno-gu","","","","","r","Located within Bukchon Hanok Village, the Traditional Crafts Experience Center is a place where you can experience traditional crafts firsthand. You can participate in various programs without reservation, and you can experience various…"],["Suyeon Sanbang","restaurant",37.59495,126.99482,"8, Seongbuk-ro 26-gil","Daily 11:30-22:00","","","","r","A tea house located in an old traditional wooden house which used to be the home of the writer Lee Tae-Jun. Try the jujube (red dates) tea and the pumpkin desserts while admiring the picturesque garden. There are only very few tables…"]]}